4,0,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! This is going to be so exciting! I wonder who the scary werewolf is? Let's all try our best to find them! Who wants to go first?,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us keep a cool head and proceed with caution. I believe it is best to listen to everyone's initial thoughts before we jump to any conclusions.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I agree with George. I think we should just... listen to each other for a bit. I'm not really sure what to say yet.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,Hello everyone. It is lovely to see you all. Let us be kind to one another as we search for the truth. I agree with George and Daisuke; let's take our time and listen.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. It's nice to meet you all. I agree with the others; let's start by getting to know each other and staying calm. I'm looking forward to working with you all to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Everyone is being so polite! It's almost too quiet, isn't it? @George, you seem very serious! Do you have a special plan for how we should find the werewolf, or are we just waiting?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"@Rin, I simply believe that haste often leads to errors. For now, I have no specific plan other than to observe how we all interact. Let us see who among us seems most anxious.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I don't really have a plan either. I'm just... a bit nervous. I hope we can all get along and find the right person without... making a mistake.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Poor Daisuke, there is no need to be so nervous. We are all here together, and we will support each other. It is perfectly alright to feel a bit anxious in a situation like this.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, please don't worry too much. It's completely natural to feel nervous. We're all in this together, and we'll support each other. Let's just take a deep breath and move forward slowly.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"You're all so nice! But if we're too gentle, the werewolf might just laugh at us! @Midori, @Shizue, do you think the werewolf is pretending to be kind too? I'm going to keep a super close eye on everyone!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"@Rin, your enthusiasm is noted, but let us not mistake kindness for deception. Suspicion without evidence can be just as dangerous as negligence. I shall continue to observe the flow of this conversation.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... I think Rin might have a point, but George is right too. It's just... hard to know who to trust. I'll try my best to pay attention, but I'm not very good at this.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a difficult position to be in, isn't it? But please don't be hard on yourself, Daisuke. We will find our way together, step by step, with patience and a warm heart.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, it's true that we should stay alert, but I believe we can be both kind and cautious. Let's trust each other for now while we look for any clues that might stand out.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'll be the best detective ever! I'm going to watch every little thing you guys do. Good luck tonight, everyone! I hope the Seer finds something super cool!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have established a reasonable atmosphere for the start. Let us hope the night brings us some clarity. I shall be reflecting on our words.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Um... good luck to everyone too. I'll try to remember everything people said... I hope we can all stay safe tonight.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Sleep well, my dear friends. May your dreams be peaceful and your hearts be light. I shall be thinking of you all. Goodnight.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Goodnight, everyone. Let's all get some rest and hope for a safe morning. I'll be thinking of you all too. Sleep well!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
