34,1,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""POSSESSED"",""alive"":true}"
35,1,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
36,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning! Did everyone sleep well? I'm so excited to see if the Seer found any clues! @George, @Daisuke, @Shizue, @Midori, does anyone feel like something spooky happened last night?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George"",""Daisuke"",""Shizue"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,"Good morning, Rin. I slept quite soundly, thank you. As for the night, only the Seer knows for certain. Let us see if anyone is willing to share their findings or if they prefer to remain silent.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... good morning. I'm still a bit scared... I hope everyone is okay. I don't have any information, but... I'm wondering if the Seer wants to tell us anything?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I am sorry to be the one to bring such heavy news to our lovely morning, but I have discovered that George is the werewolf. Please, let us stay calm.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, that is quite a shocking revelation. Are you the Seer? If you've divined George, we should listen to you, but let's make sure we understand everything clearly before we decide.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Whoa! @Shizue is the Seer?! That's so cool! But @George is the werewolf? He seemed so serious and smart, I can't believe it! Is it really true, @Shizue? Are you super sure?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shizue, that is a very bold and dangerous accusation. To claim I am the werewolf so early is a classic tactic to sow confusion. I assure you, I am a human. Why would the Seer reveal themselves so quickly?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... this is so sudden. @Shizue, are you really the Seer? I want to believe you, but @George sounds so sure... I don't know what to do. It's really hard to decide.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, it is only natural to feel conflicted. I understand your hesitation, dear. However, I am certain of what I saw. I chose to speak now so we could protect one another as soon as possible.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@George, I understand your point about the timing, but @Shizue's willingness to reveal her role suggests she's confident in her result. @Daisuke, it's okay to be unsure, but we should consider the risk of ignoring a Seer's lead.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Rin,,"If @Shizue is the Seer, then we have to believe her, right? It's like a magic clue! @George, you're acting really suspicious now that you're caught! Are you trying to trick us with your big words?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"@Rin, please do not let your excitement cloud your judgment. @Shizue is claiming a role that is easy to fake. If we execute an innocent man based on a lie, we only help the werewolf. I ask you all to think logically.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... I want to think logically too, but... @Shizue seems so sincere. If she's lying, why would she... but if @George is the werewolf, he'd say he's innocent. I'm really confused... I don't want to vote for the wrong person.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, please do not let your heart be troubled. It is a heavy burden to decide, but I promise you that I speak only the truth. I only wish for our village to be safe and peaceful once more.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, it's a difficult choice, but if @Shizue is indeed the Seer, we have a direct lead. @George, your logic is sound, but it's also what a werewolf would say to survive. I'm leaning toward trusting @Shizue.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm with @Shizue! If she's the Seer, she's our best hope! @George, you're just trying to confuse us with your fancy talking! I'm voting for George! Let's get the werewolf!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,George,,"It is a tragedy that you all are so quick to abandon reason for the sake of a simple narrative. I maintain my innocence. However, I cannot force you to see the truth. I shall accept your judgment.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... I'm sorry, George. I really don't want to make a mistake, but... I think I have to trust Shizue. She seems so sure... I'll vote for George. I'm sorry.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Thank you for your trust, Daisuke. It is a sad thing to have to do, but it is for the safety of everyone. George, I truly wish it were otherwise, but we must do what is right.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I feel for you, George, but in this situation, we have to rely on the information we have. I believe Shizue is being honest with us. I will also vote for George. I'm sorry it had to be this way.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
